Author: yunjinqi <yunjinqi@qq.com>
Date:   Fri Oct 16 11:55:41 2026 +0800

    test(arb04): group reply loss keeps UNKNOWN un-resubmitted and un-released
    
    Two integration tests over the real spawned CURVE chain (coordinator + two
    account hosts, real SQLite stores, synthetic provider leaves): the first
    orders.submit_group_leg reply is discarded after the account host executed
    it, raising the transport's genuine RequestOutcomeUnknownError. Proven: no
    resend (wire submit counts frozen at exactly 1), no early budget release,
    no reservations.release ever on the wire, recovery by the original business
    id exactly once (PAIRED, residual 0, hedge sized once), late fill refused
    without adoption or blind reverse. Independent review GO-with-disclosures;
    staging re-run at dcad4003 green (2+2 ARB04, ARB03/R121 regressions).
    
    Disclosures (clause not fully closed): cancel-under-reply-loss design-only;
    true network disconnect/recovery and duplicate fill-report not exercised;
    late-fill adoption deliberately unimplemented (refusal half only).

